<!--
  Hand-written miniature "NCR extract" used by pipelines/tests/test_publish.py
  (Task 8 publish stage). It is NOT downloaded: the publish tests must run
  offline. Coordinates are synthetic fixture values, not survey data - they are
  only plausible enough to exercise the landmark resolver, the OSM-first merge
  (ruling R29) and the GTFS geometry path without a 584 MB download.

  Named stop features the landmark resolver reads (21 nodes + 1 way stop):
    5001 Bagong Silang           public_transport=stop_position
    5002 Novaliches              public_transport=stop_position
    5003 RIZAL AVENUE            highway=bus_stop          (case-fold check)
    5004 Monumento               public_transport=platform
    5005 Paco (Obando)           public_transport=stop_position
    5006 Malabon                 highway=bus_stop
    5007 Victory Mall Monumento  public_transport=platform
    5008 Balintawak Cloverleaf   public_transport=stop_position
    5009 Baclaran Rotonda        public_transport=stop_position
    5010 Baltao                  highway=bus_stop
    5011 South Station           railway=station
    5012 Malinta                 public_transport=stop_position
    5013 Quezon Memorial Circle  public_transport=stop_position
    5014 SM Fairview             public_transport=stop_position
    5015 Commonwealth            highway=bus_stop
    5016 Molino                  public_transport=stop_position
    5017 Alabang                 railway=station
    5018 Cubao                   public_transport=stop_position
    5019 Baclaran                public_transport=stop_position
    5020 North Avenue            railway=station
    5021 Quezon Avenue           railway=station
    way 6001 "Binan Poblacion"   public_transport=platform, centroid of nodes
                                 5022/5023 - matches the seed's "Biñan
                                 Poblacion" after diacritic folding.

  Named ways that are NOT stops (must never become landmarks):
    6101 "EDSA"            highway=primary  (geometry for bus B1)
    6102 "MRT-3 track"     railway=subway   (geometry for rail MRT-3)
    6103 "Susano Road"     highway=primary  (geometry for OSM jeep T101)
    6104 "Pasig River"     route=ferry      (geometry for ferry Pasig)
    6002 "Some Road"       highway=primary

  Route relations:
    7001 route=bus        ref=B1      -> bus-b1
    7002 route=light_rail ref=MRT-3   -> rail-mrt3
    7003 route=jeepney    ref=T101    -> jeep-t101  (collides with the curated
                                        T101 once curated ids are lowercased:
                                        ruling R29; the OSM route must win)
    7004 route=ferry      ref=Pasig   -> ferry-pasig (no stop members, so its
                                        landmark stops are synthesized)
    7005 route=bus        ref=B2      -> bus-b2, whose only way member (9999) is
                                        dangling, so the GTFS builder must skip
                                        it and count the skip (osm_routes_skipped)
-->
